{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the wilderness with a small bush plane. Challenge your flying skills by landing on rough terrain and battling wind, fog, rain, snow, and the darkness of night. There are no runways here, you can refuel at small checkpoints, where you have to decide the right way of approach. Discover a variety of biomes and enjoy the beautiful views throughout your adventure. Can you complete the full travel checklist?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty\u00a0</strong>- You may want to just have a relaxing flight after a tough day at work, or you may want to really challenge yourself by flying into the worst conditions possible. Either way, you can tweak the toughness of the game to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Open World</strong> - Each time you start a new game, you do so in a new world to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simcade Flight Mechanics</strong> - This game features a simplified flight model with a focus on being fun. This model produces some realistic scenarios, like landing in crosswind, stalling, and using instruments in low visibility. However, there are no trim tabs, propeller reaction forces or any advanced aerodynamics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No LLMs, AI code assistants, or asset generators were used during the development of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152310?t=1762874943","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152310?t=1762874943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152310/777d9be4dc8caecc017a01cdde05c8cfaa3c61bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762874943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152310/777d9be4dc8caecc017a01cdde05c8cfaa3c61bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762874943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the wilderness with a small bush plane. Challenge your flying skills by landing on rough terrain and battling wind, fog, rain, snow, and the darkness of night. There are no runways here, you can refuel at small checkpoints, where you have to decide the right way of approach. Discover a variety of biomes and enjoy the beautiful views throughout your adventure. Can you complete the full travel checklist?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty\u00a0</strong>- You may want to just have a relaxing flight after a tough day at work, or you may want to really challenge yourself by flying into the worst conditions possible. Either way, you can tweak the toughness of the game to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Open World</strong> - Each time you start a new game, you do so in a new world to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simcade Flight Mechanics</strong> - This game features a simplified flight model with a focus on being fun. This model produces some realistic scenarios, like landing in crosswind, stalling, and using instruments in low visibility. However, there are no trim tabs, propeller reaction forces or any advanced aerodynamics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No LLMs, AI code assistants, or asset generators were used during the development of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["dimitars"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152310/251c21ff67dad48f77894f33719cbfad1f35b9bd/header.jpg?t=1762874943","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2018<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200, AMD FX-4100, Raspberry Pi 4<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 2500 (Ivy Bridge), AMD Radeon R5 Graphics (Kaveri)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo SU9400, Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 2500 (Ivy Bridge), AMD Radeon R5 Graphics (Kaveri)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4152310/1605052553/fe25f96fa26af5eb73d3846a1b5c77c26a9b3fd7/1762872609/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762874941","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4152310/1605052553/fe25f96fa26af5eb73d3846a1b5c77c26a9b3fd7/1762872609/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762874941","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4152310/1605052553/fe25f96fa26af5eb73d3846a1b5c77c26a9b3fd7/1762872609/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762874941","id":257229620,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257229620/movie480.mp4?t=1762874941","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257229620/movie_max.mp4?t=1762874941"},"name":"Bush 1022 Island Lake Landing","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati